			"notes": "Porting to 1.16.2 was a big task, but we finally got it done. \n\nNew Features:-\n- Limbo Gateways\n- Eternal fluid and gateway teleportation from limbo\n- New schematic placer. You can check out the converted public and private pocket schematics by using the `/schematicv2` command\n- Dark Limbo sky\n- Better Dimensional Portal rendering\n- Working config\n- Fixed a few bugs with mixins not applying properly\n- Revamped limbo\n- Conditionally created block entities for doors \n\n![2020-10-03_20 19 16](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/62552372/94994719-2736f800-05b7-11eb-9f37-440f0fc49fca.png)"
		},
