			"notes": "This is the first alpha of dimensional doors for fabric 1.16. This alpha includes the new revamped limbo done by BoogieMonster1O1, a member of the fabric community who has volunteered to help out. The mod is by no means complete. This release is purely to show off limbo. You can access it by using /dimteleport limbo. Be ready for appearing in the middle of unraveled fabric due to where the command seems to spawn you at the moment."
